OL,3,GNEWSAMen jailed after underground
OL,4,Acannabis farm found
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo men have been jailed after an
OL,7,Funderground cannabis farm was found
OL,8,Fnear a Warwickshire village.
OL,10,FPolice officers found an
OL,11,F"inconspicuous" shipping container near
OL,12,FWolston in August. Inside it they
OL,13,Fdiscovered an entry hatch which led
OL,14,Fthem down into a subterranean farm with
OL,15,Fan estimated #500,000 crop of cannabis
OL,16,Fgrowing.
OL,18,FGjergivatal Pjeter, 33, of New Market
OL,19,FStreet, Birmingham, and Eldoh Sylaj,
OL,20,F31, of Upper Stone Street, Maidstone,
OL,21,Fadmitted being involved in producing
OL,22,Fthe Class B drug.
OL,23,APub: 27-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,354,350,200,160,0,100
